@startuml
 title Account creation event flow
autonumber
actor Administrator as Admin
participant "application web" as app
participant "API Gateway" as GW
participant "user-management-service" as UM
queue Kafka
participant "iam-service" as IAM
database "database of data" as DB

Admin -> app: enters data and role
app -> GW: request of creation
GW -> UM: create Person
UM -> UM: validates document and data
UM -> DB: stores Person
UM -> Kafka: publishes evento of person created
Kafka -> IAM: delivery evento
IAM -> IAM: creates Profile with role
IAM -> DB: stores Profile active
IAM --> UM: confirms processing
UM --> app: account created
app --> Admin: confirmation
@enduml

